    "audience": "ministry",
    "order": 26,
    "title": "Expression operations map",
    "path": "4 Lead and operate an Expression > Expression operations map",
    "content": "Area\nAvailable tools\nContent and gatherings\nContent Studio Live Studio Sermons Events Announcements Feed Ranking Testimony review and Prayer\nPeople and access\nLeadership Titles & badges Invite Codes Team Access Ownership and Settings\nGiving and finance\nGiving Setup Giving Reports and Financial Management",
    "sourceDocumentId": "13AM5RK4CuJffYe9zIF2iew1VWBneg7YrskL4dNh23hU",
