    "content": "CITY OF TRANSFORMATION\nComplete role and operating guide for the separate COT App Platform Administration website\nUse this guide to understand platform roles, permission-driven navigation, governance, service operations, feature availability, moderation, security, and audit.\nFor authorised COT App Platform Administrators",
    "sourceDocumentId": "17SeNvbifGeuAL7pV-2TkbnZ_ZGr1S-GI0U5ZdPH4XLw",
